  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Clinton Climate Initiative - Phase II 2017-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Clinton Climate Initiative (CCI) is an initiative of the Clinton Foundation. CCI helps small island developing states (SIDS) in the Caribbean and the Indian Ocean transition from fossil-based to renewable energy generation. CCI provides technical assistance to SIDS to overcome barriers associated with development of renewable energy projects. Critical barriers are unfamiliarity with new technologies, high project preparation costs and limited financial or technical capacity in SIDS to have projects accepted for concessional rates by multilateral lenders. Norway is the main donor and has supported the Clinton Climate Initiative&#x2019;s work in SIDS since 2012.</narrative>
  </description>
